{
  "project": {
    "name": "Sweater Vest",
    "slug": "sweater-vest",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "engine": "fc",
    "description": {
      "en": "The knit pullover V-neck vest: a sleeveless cut-and-sew knit layer with a deep V neck and ribbed neck/armhole/hem bands, worn over a shirt. Distinct from FC-100's woven vests (waistcoat, puffer-vest, hi-vis, utility-vest) — this is a knit pullover. Front and back share the body width so the seams balance; the bands are cut to the measured openings. A soft-goods garment — no hardware. FC-200 long-tail (knitwear gap).\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Fashion Cabinet",
      "es": "El chaleco de punto con cuello en V: una capa de punto sin mangas de corte y confección con cuello en V profundo y bandas de canalé en cuello/sisas/ruedo, para llevar sobre camisa. Distinto de los chalecos de tela de FC-100 (chaleco sastre, acolchado, alta visibilidad, utilitario) — este es un jersey de punto. Frente y espalda comparten el ancho del cuerpo, así que las costuras se equilibran; las bandas se cortan a las aberturas medidas. Una prenda textil — sin herrajes. Cola larga FC-200 (hueco de punto).\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Fashion Cabinet",
      "fr": "Le gilet en maille à col en V : une couche en maille sans manches, coupée-cousue, avec un col en V profond et des bandes côtelées à l'encolure/emmanchures/ourlet, portée sur une chemise. Distinct des gilets tissés de FC-100 (gilet de costume, matelassé, haute visibilité, utilitaire) — celui-ci est un pull en maille. Devant et dos partagent la largeur du corps, donc les coutures s'équilibrent ; les bandes sont coupées aux ouvertures mesurées. Un vêtement textile — sans quincaillerie. Longue traîne FC-200 (manque maille).\n\nVisualiseur et configurateur officiel : Fashion Cabinet"
    },
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": [
      "sweater-vest",
      "knit",
      "v-neck",
      "pullover",
      "commons",
      "made-to-measure"
    ],
    "attribution": {
      "author": "Innovaciones MADFAM",
      "license": "CERN-OHL-W-2.0",
      "lineage": [
        {
          "source": "Original draft for Fashion Cabinet",
          "license": "original"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "modes": [
    {
      "id": "set",
      "label": {
        "en": "Full Vest",
        "es": "Chaleco completo",
        "fr": "Gilet complet"
      },
      "script_file": "main.py",
      "pieces": [
        "front",
        "back",
        "band"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pieces": [
    {
      "id": "front",
      "label": {
        "en": "Front (V-neck)",
        "es": "Frente (cuello V)",
        "fr": "Devant (col V)"
      },
      "default_color": "#5a5a3a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "fold_edge": "center",
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "back",
      "label": {
        "en": "Back",
        "es": "Espalda",
        "fr": "Dos"
      },
      "default_color": "#5a5a3a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "fold_edge": "center",
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "band",
      "label": {
        "en": "Ribbed band",
        "es": "Banda de canalé",
        "fr": "Bande côtelée"
      },
      "default_color": "#4a4a2a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1
      }
    }
  ],
  "parameter_groups": [
    {
      "id": "body",
      "label": {
        "en": "Body Measurements",
        "es": "Medidas Corporales",
        "fr": "Mesures du corps"
      }
    },
    {
